":0.1,"maxLabel":"满进化 · 满觉醒"}]}],"options":[{"id":10900,"level":70,"name":"队伍暴击率提升"}]}],"illustrations":[{"name":"原版立绘","asset":{"key":"illust:illust_sapa_dragontalon_minion","skin":null},"stage":null}],"costumes":[],"weapons":[],"profile":{"Age":[22],"Height":[92],"Weight":[20]},"tribes":["人类"],"story":"东泰，总部设在消逝之都的秘密组织龙爪派的执行队长。\n\n坚信龙爪派能征服全世界，时刻准备接收新队员。\n\n认为岚芳的神龙人偶服帅气十足，作为英雄战服再合适不过了。偶尔独自一人遐想自己身穿专属英雄战服的模样。每次东泰设计的战服都没有定稿，最近看了一段浣熊视频，这只浣熊品尝棉花糖会先冲洗一番。于是，东泰就画了一身浣熊战服。","storyKey":"profile_sapa_dragontalon_minion_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=224","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=224","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"]},"voiceLines":[{"id":"sapa_dragontalon_minion","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["神↓龙↑神↓爪↑派～"],"enUS":["Dra-gon Ta-lon Clan!"],"jaJP":["竜↘の↗つ↘め↗団↓～"]},"keys":["Voice_sapa_dragontalon_minion_1_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["世界属于我们龙爪派！"],"enUS":["Dragon Talon Clan will conquer the world!"],"jaJP":["世界は竜の爪団のものだ！"]},"keys":["Voice_sapa_dragontalon_minion_1_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["嗯嗯，有点困，是不是该睡了…？"],"enUS":["Mmm, I'm sleepy... should I call it a day...?"],"jaJP":["ううん、眠いなあ…今日はもう寝ちゃうか…"]},"keys":["Voice_sapa_dragontalon_minion_1_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["这座浮游城有点简陋，勉强当做我们龙爪派总部吧！"],"enUS":["It's a bit shabby, but I'll make Heavenhold the hideout of the Dragon Talon clan!"],"jaJP":["少しむさくるしいが、この浮遊城を我が竜の爪団のアジトにしてやろう！"]},"keys":["Voice_sapa_dragontalon_minion_1_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["信鸽来过，首领有指令吗？！"],"enUS":["A homing pigeon came by. Is it a message from the boss?!"],"jaJP":["伝書鳩が来たな…ボスの伝言か！？"]},"keys":["Voice_sapa_dragontalon_minion_1_NoticeMail"]}]}]}
